title AVG-07 Suspend, Reactivate or Delist a Service
fontsize 20
gap 200
participant Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin
participant Zetrix_Registry_Admin
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==SUSPEND==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:suspend (reason)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:set Suspended first (calls rejected within 60 s; API keys kept)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC (status on Zetrix chain)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Zetrix_Registry:hide listing + mirror
==REACTIVATE==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:reactivate (reason)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:if suspended by Zetrix, only Zetrix can reactivate
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:set Active
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert (old stays revoked)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Zetrix_Registry:show listing + mirror
==DELIST (PERMANENT)==
Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:delist (reason, typed service name)
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->AVG:revoke all API keys; set Delisted
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->SSIVC:revoke Service Cert
SSIVC->MBI:revoke VC
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Zetrix_Registry:remove listing + mirror; deactivate did:oan
alt CLIENT TRIES TO LIFT A ZETRIX SUSPENSION
Zetrix_Registry_Admin-->Checker_Client_Admin_or_Super_Admin:Only Zetrix can reactivate this service.
end
alt SERVICE CERT REVOKE FAILS
Zetrix_Registry_Admin->Zetrix_Registry_Admin:service stays blocked in AVG; cert revoke failed, Retry
end
